NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000891 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000892 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000893 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=IPC-System-Options>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000894 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000895 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
